s were higher, than leftmost smallest, and were watered not least times. So, after we moved the answer had not decreased. So, new sequence is also optimal. So, there is sequence of moves, which consists the segment, which starts at the initially leftmost smallest flower. So, let use this. Similary to other of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" days, and it would be optimally. "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/460/submission/7536171"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"7536171"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/460/problem/D"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"460D - Little Victor and Set"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≤ 4 we can all subsets of size not greater than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Else, if "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1, obviously that answer is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 2, answer is 1, because "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"xor"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" of numbers 2"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and 2"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + 1 equls 1. If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≥ 4 answer is 0 because "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"xor"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" of to pairs with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","tex